+"""LED-04 ruling (a): §4-4 prices a pre-fix TRANSFER day from the amendment record, and names the
+days it could not.
+
+*** MOCK ONLY: pilot_log trees built in tmp, watchdog.evaluate only (no broker, no state written,
+    no venue, no network). ***
+
+THE DEFECT (FIXPROGRAM_2026-09-13 §9, lead's ruling (a); FX-EXEC2's measurement receipt
+quant_research docs/fixprogram_2026-09-13/FX_EXEC2/receipts/LED04_cond4_transfer_day_effect.json):
